        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The River of Time has dried up, plunging parallel worlds into chaos. True spirits that stirred ripples in the river have been resurrected, entering a realm governed by bizarre rules. A great calamity has arisen, and the path to transcendence has appeared.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Pet System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 720 types of monsters and mythical beasts await in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to obtain Pet Eggs—every monster, including bosses, can be tamed as a pet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Gem System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various gems and socket them into equipment to boost combat power.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Equipment System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm materials by defeating monsters and craft powerful gear using collected resources.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Skill System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot a diverse array of skills from monsters, with over 240 skill combinations to customize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Quest System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in engaging storylines through the game's quest system.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Teleportation System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly teleport to any map anytime, anywhere for convenient AFK monster grinding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7. AFK System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy hands-free gameplay with the AFK feature—grind for equipment effortlessly while away from your screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8. Boss Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter powerful bosses randomly in the wild. Defeat them to claim rare and valuable loot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9. Auto-Loot</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically collect valuable items dropped by monsters during your adventures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10. Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK mode, adjustable sound settings, auto-equipment selection, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our QQ Group: 339510891</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The River of Time has dried up, plunging parallel worlds into chaos. True spirits that stirred ripples in the river have been resurrected, entering a realm governed by bizarre rules. A great calamity has arisen, and the path to transcendence has appeared.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Pet System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 720 types of monsters and mythical beasts await in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to obtain Pet Eggs—every monster, including bosses, can be tamed as a pet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Gem System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various gems and socket them into equipment to boost combat power.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Equipment System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm materials by defeating monsters and craft powerful gear using collected resources.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Skill System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot a diverse array of skills from monsters, with over 240 skill combinations to customize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Quest System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in engaging storylines through the game's quest system.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6. Teleportation System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly teleport to any map anytime, anywhere for convenient AFK monster grinding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>7. AFK System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy hands-free gameplay with the AFK feature—grind for equipment effortlessly while away from your screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8. Boss Battles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter powerful bosses randomly in the wild. Defeat them to claim rare and valuable loot.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9. Auto-Loot</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically collect valuable items dropped by monsters during your adventures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10. Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK mode, adjustable sound settings, auto-equipment selection, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our QQ Group: 339510891</p>",
